#ACTION   SOURCE   DEST   PROTO   DESTPORT(S)

# What stays reachable when the firewall is `shorewall stop`ped.
# Keep SSH alive both ways so you never lock yourself out.
ACCEPT    -        fw     tcp     22
ACCEPT    fw       -      tcp     22

###############################################################################
# Compute worker nodes may be booted from NFS, so ensure that NFS remains
# available at all times.
#
# rpcbind/portmapper(111), nfsd(2049), mountd(20048),
# lockd(32765), statd(32767). TCP and UDP both, to be safe.
ACCEPT   fw   -   tcp   111,2049,20048,32765,32767
ACCEPT   fw   -   udp   111,2049,20048,32765,32767
#
# Needed for NFSv3 callbacks (statd/lockd) from server -> client.
ACCEPT   -   fw
###############################################################################